ected(base) // Shouts to parent: "Hey, a new base was chosen!"\n                            expanded = false\n                        }\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n\n        Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\n            Checkbox(\n                checked = isVip, // Reads value from parameter\n                onCheckedChange = { onVipChanged(it) } // Shouts to parent about checkbox change\n            )\n            Text("Dost\u0119p do lo\u017cy Zero-G (VIP)")\n        }\n    }\n}\n'})}),"\n",(0,o.jsxs)(n.h3,{id:"bookingsummarykt",children:[(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{children:"BookingSummary.kt"}),":"]}),"\n",(0,o.jsx)(n.pre,{children:(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{className:"language-kotlin",children:'//  THE SUMMARY COMPONENT (Stateless) - Only displays received data\n@Composable\nfun BookingSummary(\n    destination: String,\n    isVip: Boolean\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n        colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(containerColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.secondaryContainer)\n    ) {\n        Column(\n            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),\n            horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally\n        ) {\n            Text("Karta Pok\u0142adowa", style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            Text("Cel: $destination")\n            Text("Status: ${if (isVip) "VIP" else "Standard"}")\n        }\n    }\n}\n'})}),"\n",(0,o.jsxs)(n.h3,{id:"lunarticketingappkt",children:[(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{children:"LunarTicketingApp.kt"}),":"]}),"\n",(0,o.jsx)(n.pre,{children:(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{className:"language-kotlin",children:'val lunarBases = listOf("Tycho Base", "Sea of Tranquility", "Copernicus Crater")\n\n//  THE PARENT COMPONENT (Stateful)\n@Composable\nfun LunarTicketingApp() {\n    // State is "hoisted" up so multiple child components can share it\n    var selectedBase by remember { mutableStateOf(lunarBases[0]) }\n    var vipAccess by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }\n\n    Column(\n        modifier = Modifier.padding(24.dp).fillMaxWidth(),\n        horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally\n    ) {\n        Text("Wybierz cel podr\xf3\u017cy", style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleLarge)\n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(24.dp))\n\n        // Passing state (down) and event-reacting lambdas (up)\n        TicketingForm(\n            currentBase = selectedBase,\n            onBaseSelected = { newBase -> selectedBase = newBase }, // Updates parent\'s state\n            isVip = vipAccess,\n            onVipChanged = { newVipStatus -> vipAccess = newVipStatus } // Updates parent\'s state\n        )\n\n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(32.dp))\n\n        // This component only receives data to display (Stateless)\n        BookingSummary(\n            destination = selectedBase,\n            isVip = vipAccess\n        )\n    }\n}\n'})}),"\n",(0,o.jsx)(n.p,{children:(0,o.jsx)(n.strong,{children:"\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude80 Astronaut's Dilemma (Think about it):"})}),"\n",(0,o.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:["\n",(0,o.jsxs)(n.li,{children:["*Why does ",(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{children:"TicketingForm"})," remember if the menu is open (",(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{children:"expanded"}),"), but it absolutely refuses\nto remember which base\nwas actually selected?"]}),"\n",(0,o.jsxs)(n.li,{children:["Why did we force the parent ",(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{children:"LunarTicketingApp"})," to hold the ",(0,o.jsx)(n.code,{children:"selectedBase"}),"?*"]}),"\n"]}),"\n",(0,o.jsx)(n.hr,{}),"\n",(0,o.jsx)(n.h2,{id:"2-anatomy-of-the-exposeddropdownmenubox",children:"2. Anatomy of the ExposedDropdownMenuBox"}),"\n",(0,o.jsx)(n.p,{children:"Before we analyze the data flow, let's look at how the dropdown itself is physically constructed.\nIt consists of four intertwined pieces working together to create the illusion of a dropdown:"}),"\n",(0,o.jsxs)(n.ol